.TH MM-COMMON-GET 1 2019-09-12 GNOME "mm-common 1.0.8"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
mm-common-get \- Copy files from mm-common to a C++ binding module that uses Meson
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B mm-common-get
.RI [ OPTION "]... " "BUILDSCRIPT-DIR DOCTOOL-DIR"
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Run
.B mm-common-get
to copy the
.I mm-common
build support files into the source tree of a C++ binding module.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
forcefully replace existing files
.TP
.B \-\-help
display a help message and exit
.TP
.B \-\-version
show version information and exit
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
The exit status is 0 if OK, or 1 if an error occurred.
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
The build support files currently copied by
.B mm-common-get
are listed below.
.TP
.BI "Meson build scripts copied to " BUILDSCRIPT-DIR :
.PD 0
.IP
.I check-dllexport-usage.py
.IP
.I dist-build-scripts.py
.IP
.I dist-changelog.py
.IP
.I doc-reference.py
.IP
.I generate-binding.py
.PD
.TP
.BI "Documentation utilities copied to " DOCTOOL-DIR :
.PD 0
.IP
.I doc_install.py
.IP
.I doc_postprocess.py
.IP
.I doxygen.css
.IP
.I doxygen-extra.css
.IP
.I tagfile-to-devhelp2.xsl
.PD
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PD 0
.BR mm-common-prepare (1)
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/mm-common/README
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/mm-common/skeletonmm.tar.xz or
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/mm-common/skeletonmm.tar.gz
.PD
